# Generated by suievals/build.js at deploy time, one HTML and one JSON per run
# that ranks on the board.
#
# It was committed, and it was 2.7M of a 6.1M repository -- the largest thing in
# it, and growing by two files per published card. `npx skills add
# mystenlabs/skills` clones the whole repository to install skills from it, so
# every user downloaded all of it to use none of it.
#
# Derivable, too: a rebuild emits exactly the records the current board links to.
# Of the 39 files committed here, a build regenerated 10 -- the rest were records
# of runs that stopped ranking when #106 renamed the suite, still in the tree
# with nothing pointing at them.
suievals/runs/

# Generated by suievals/build.js, like suievals/runs/.
#
# They were committed, and they went stale and stayed stale: evals/index.json
# said 158 evals and manifest 143c0d0525d3 while the suite was 156 and
# f0b70209ffb6, so build.test.js failed on main on every run.
#
# suievals-board.yml was meant to keep them fresh by rebuilding and pushing, and
# it cannot: main is a protected branch, so every run built correctly, passed its
# tests, and died on `git push` with GH006. A generated file that only one
# unpushable job may update is a file that is always wrong.
#
# Nothing needs the committed copies. The Vercel build runs build.js before it
# serves anything, and so does CI. See suievals/DEPLOY.md.
suievals/evals/index.json
suievals/results/index.json
